# No web env vars are required.
#
# Live Tracking (/tracking) draws its map with Leaflet + OpenStreetMap tiles,
# which need no API key. OSM's public tile server is meant for light use — for
# heavy production traffic, point this at a tile provider (Stadia, MapTiler,
# self-hosted, ...). Optional; must be a Leaflet URL template.
# VITE_MAP_TILE_URL=https://tiles.example.com/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
#
# The public customer tracking page (/track/:code) uses VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_JS_KEY
# if set (see src/lib/loadGoogleMaps.ts); without it, it shows no map.
